# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit real values.
#
# Google Maps / Places browser key for the MapGoogle, GooglePlacesAutocomplete
# and PlaceList stories. Use a key restricted to the Maps JavaScript + Places
# APIs and to http://localhost:4503/* plus the deployed Storybook origin.
# Without it the map stories render but Google calls fail. See README
# "Google Maps API key".
STORYBOOK_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
